message: "If you use Audio Analyzer, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Audio Analyzer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hammer"
    given-names: "Carsten"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-1047-6381"
repository-code: "https://github.com/carstenartur/audio-analyzer"
url: "https://github.com/carstenartur/audio-analyzer"
abstract: >-
  Audio Analyzer is a Java 21 research and engineering platform for reproducible
  audio experimentation and versioned digital signal processing workflows. It
  combines desktop signal analysis, collaborative workflow editing, deterministic
  domain models, recording and replay, evidence export, semantic history and an
  explicitly experimental acoustic-localization module.
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0-SNAPSHOT"
